# Ghost Vacuum's second ability makes each creature it exiled "a 1/1 Spirit in addition to its other types". Artificial
# Evolution changes the text of Bot1's Ghost Vacuum, Spirit to Elf (CR 612.1), so the Dark Confidant it released is
# a 1/1 Elf in addition to its other types, not a Spirit (CR 612). The Vacuum has been sacrificed by then: the ability
# reads the words its source last had on the battlefield (CR 113.7a).

